OL,3,GNorthern Ireland
OL,4,
OL,5,CToday:FA cloudy morning with rain,
OL,6,Fheavy at first, clearing to the
OL,7,Fnortheast. The afternoon will then be
OL,8,Flargely dry with the odd shower
OL,9,Fpossible and sunny spells breaking
OL,10,Fthrough. Breezy in the morning but
OL,11,Fwinds easing later.
OL,12,
OL,13,CTonight:FMostly dry with clear
OL,14,Fintervals in the evening. Staying
OL,15,Fmostly dry overnight with clear
OL,16,Fspells, allowing some mist and fog
OL,17,Fpatches to form. Rather cold.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
OL,24,ANext Page  BWeather  CReg News  FReg TV
