OL,3,GNorthern Ireland
OL,4,
OL,5,CThursday:FAny isolated mist and fog
OL,6,Fsoon clearing to a dry day with long
OL,7,Fsunny spells before clouding over
OL,8,Ftowards the evening.
OL,9,
OL,10,COutlook for Friday to Sunday:FBreezy
OL,11,Fwith rain early Friday clearing to
OL,12,Fmostly dry conditions and sunny
OL,13,Fspells. Spells of heavy rain over the
OL,14,Fweekend with winds strengthening and
OL,15,Fbringing a risk of gales.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
